The no-cut-while-P1/P2-open rule is a start condition, checked once when
the cut starts. The release PR records the check; a late P1/P2 is named
under Known issues and ships in the next minor. Only the maintainer can
stop a cut for one.

PROCESS_VERSION 55.

Fixes #1424

